# Generated outputs. The bulk (activations, responses, vectors) is far too large for
# git -- a single caa_activations dir is ~2.5GB -- so outputs/ is ignored by default.
# The exception is outputs/*/analysis/: metrics JSON and figures, a few MB, worth
# versioning so results are reviewable in a PR without a HF download.
outputs/**
!outputs/**/
!outputs/*/analysis/**
# Cross-arm analyses live at outputs/analysis/ rather than under a single model, because
# they compare arms and belong to none of them. That path does NOT match the pattern above
# (which requires a model directory in between), so it needs its own rule -- without it the
# dose, common-shift and calibration results were ignored and existed only on the pod's
# network volume.
!outputs/analysis/**

